{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45630","headline":"读顾况歌行 · 贯休","name":"读顾况歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪泥露金冰滴瓦，枫柽火着僧留坐。\n忽覩逋翁一轴歌，始觉诗魔辜负我。\n花飞飞，雪霏霏，三珠树晓珠累累。\n妖狐爬出西子骨，雷车拶破织女机。\n忆昔鄱阳寺中见一碣，逋翁词兮逋翁札。\n庾翼未伏王右军，李白不知谁拟杀。\n别，别，若非仙眼应难别。\n不可说，不可说，离乱乱离应打折。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45630.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45630","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}